msgid "Getting it ready…"
msgstr "Wordt klaargezet…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7466
msgid ""
"It couldn't be installed. Check the internet connection, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Het kon niet worden geïnstalleerd. Controleer de internetverbinding en probeer het opnieuw."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7467
msgid ""
"Windows key + Alt + G keeps the last 30 seconds on screen in Videos. The first time, choose the screen to record."
msgstr ""
"Windows-toets + Alt + G bewaart de laatste 30 seconden van het scherm in Video's. Kies de eerste keer het scherm dat wordt opgenomen."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7480 linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7623 linux/libexec/monet-quick:5498
msgid "Shared with Windows"
msgstr "Gedeeld met Windows"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7492 linux/libexec/monet-quick:4054
msgid "Windows games"
msgstr "Windows-games"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7493
msgid "Install each game once"
msgstr "Installeer elke game maar één keer"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7494
msgid ""
"Windows didn't shut down fully, so its drive isn't open to Monet this time. It is again after your next trip to Windows."
msgstr ""
"Windows is niet helemaal afgesloten, dus de schijf ervan is deze keer niet open voor Monet. Na je volgende uitstapje naar Windows weer wel."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7495
msgid ""
"Windows wants to check its drive first. It does that by itself the next time it starts."
msgstr ""
"Windows wil eerst zijn schijf controleren. Dat doet het vanzelf bij de volgende start."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7497
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is encrypted with BitLocker. Start Windows once, and Monet Bridge hands its recovery key over: Monet opens it by itself from then on. Or type the key here."
msgstr ""
"De Windows-schijf is versleuteld met BitLocker. Start Windows één keer, dan geeft Monet Bridge de herstelsleutel door: Monet opent hem daarna zelf. Of typ de sleutel hier."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7498
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is encrypted with BitLocker. Type its recovery key once, and Monet opens it at every start, for games, files and Wi-Fi in both."
msgstr ""
"De schijf van Windows is versleuteld met BitLocker. Typ de herstelsleutel één keer, en Monet opent de schijf bij elke start, voor games, bestanden en wifi in allebei."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7499
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is open. Monet Bridge installs itself the next time Windows starts, and from then on games, files and Wi-Fi work in both."
msgstr ""
"De schijf van Windows is open. Monet Bridge installeert zichzelf de volgende keer dat Windows start, en vanaf dan werken games, bestanden en wifi in allebei."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7500
msgid "Windows' drive couldn't be opened this time."
msgstr "De schijf van Windows kon deze keer niet worden geopend."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7501
msgid ""
"Steam here and Steam in Windows both play from it. When you install a game, choose Windows games, and it's ready on both."
msgstr ""
"Steam hier en Steam in Windows spelen er allebei vanaf. Kies bij het installeren van een game 'Windows games', dan staat hij aan beide kanten klaar."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7502
msgid ""
"Steam here can keep games in Windows' Games folder, where Windows plays them too. Steam closes for a moment to add it."
msgstr ""
"Steam hier kan games in de Games-map van Windows bewaren, waar Windows ze ook speelt. Steam sluit even om die toe te voegen."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7503
msgid ""
"Steam keeps games for both in Windows' Games folder for the person who set up this PC."
msgstr ""
"Steam bewaart games voor beide in de Games-map van Windows, voor wie deze pc heeft ingesteld."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7539
msgid "Recovery key, 48 digits"
msgstr "Herstelsleutel, 48 cijfers"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7545
msgid "Unlocking…"
msgstr "Ontgrendelen…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7545
msgid "Unlock"
msgstr "Ontgrendelen"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7553
msgid ""
"It's in your Microsoft account, or in Windows: search for Manage BitLocker, then Back up your recovery key."
msgstr ""
"Je vindt hem in je Microsoft-account, of in Windows: zoek naar BitLocker beheren en kies dan Back-up van uw herstelsleutel maken."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7560
msgid "Find my key"
msgstr "Mijn sleutel zoeken"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7568 linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7575 setup/monet_setup/app.py:50
msgid "Epic and GOG games"
msgstr "Games van Epic en GOG"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7569
msgid ""
"In Heroic, choose Windows games as the folder when you install one, and Windows plays it too: Epic's launcher there takes it over, and GOG's games start by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Kies in Heroic 'Windows games' als map als je er een installeert, dan speelt Windows hem ook: de Epic-launcher daar neemt hem over en GOG-games starten vanzelf."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7576
msgid ""
"Get Heroic for your Epic and GOG games. One you install in Windows games plays in Windows too."
msgstr ""
"Haal Heroic voor je Epic- en GOG-games. Een game die je in 'Windows games' installeert, speelt ook in Windows."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7579
msgid "Getting Heroic…"
msgstr "Heroic ophalen…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7579
msgid "Get Heroic"
msgstr "Heroic ophalen"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7594
msgid "Battle.net, Ubisoft and EA games"
msgstr "Games van Battle.net, Ubisoft en EA"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7595
msgid ""
"In Battle.net, Ubisoft Connect or the EA app here, install to drive W: (Windows games), and Windows plays it too. The first time, its launcher there may ask where it is: Play says what to pick."
msgstr ""
"Installeer in Battle.net, Ubisoft Connect of de EA-app hier op station W: (Windows-games), dan speelt Windows hem ook. De eerste keer vraagt de launcher daar misschien waar hij staat: Spelen zegt wat je kiest."

