msgstr "%1 openen"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7606
msgid "Get %1"
msgstr "%1 ophalen"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7624
msgid ""
"A folder Windows has too, as Shared with Monet: save a download, a mod or an installer there once, and it's in both. Files lists it with your places."
msgstr ""
"Een map die Windows ook heeft, als 'Shared with Monet': sla er één keer een download, een mod of een installatieprogramma in op, en het staat in beide. Bestanden toont hem bij je locaties."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7634
msgid "Where your games are"
msgstr "Waar je games staan"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7660
msgid "Steam, Heroic and Lutris keep theirs here once you install one"
msgstr ""
"Steam, Heroic en Lutris zetten hun games hier zodra je er een installeert"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7667
msgid "Needs Windows"
msgstr "Heeft Windows nodig"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7681
msgid ""
"Its anti-cheat only allows Windows. It's in Windows games, ready there."
msgstr ""
"De anti-cheat staat alleen Windows toe. Hij staat in 'Windows games', klaar daar."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7682
msgid "Its anti-cheat only allows Windows. It's there too."
msgstr "De anti-cheat staat alleen Windows toe. De game staat daar ook."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7683
msgid ""
"Its anti-cheat only allows Windows. In Steam, move it to Windows games (Properties, Installed Files, Move install folder), and it's ready there."
msgstr ""
"De anti-cheat staat alleen Windows toe. Verplaats hem in Steam naar 'Windows games' (Eigenschappen, Geïnstalleerde bestanden, Installatiemap verplaatsen), dan staat hij daar klaar."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7684
msgid ""
"Its anti-cheat only allows Windows. Install it in Windows' Steam to play."
msgstr ""
"De anti-cheat staat alleen Windows toe. Installeer de game in Steam op Windows om te spelen."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7688
msgid "Play on Windows…"
msgstr "Spelen in Windows…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7701
msgid "Which games need Windows comes from AreWeAntiCheatYet and ProtonDB."
msgstr ""
"Welke games Windows nodig hebben, komt van AreWeAntiCheatYet en ProtonDB."

